  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Health Sector Support</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to assist the Kingdom of Tonga in improving the performance of its health sector by supporting selected reforms to said health sector, including: (i)the development and implementation of appropriate health financing policies, and health information systems; and (ii) the improvement of the adminiistrative, functional and technical quality of health facilities.</narrative>
  </description>
